From 8dc9f941042fd05dc044f3d31535cd2208c7a95d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Budik OS <info@budikstore.org>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 08:02:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: one volume slider first, the full card on demand

A volume key showed the whole card with the ringer segment and three
sliders at once. Like on iOS and Pixel it now shows only the slider of
the stream the keys change (media while playing, otherwise the ringer,
the call during a call) at the edge, with a round key below that
expands the card to the ringer segment, the media / ringer / alarm
sliders and the "Zvuk" key. The card grows with a spring; it is compact
again the next time it shows. Timeout and dismissal stay the AOSP logic.
